DESCRIPTION:Are you financially savvy enough? Join this session to enhance your knowledge and understanding of financial concepts, products, and practices. What to eyeball when doing budgeting, saving, investing, managing debt, understanding credit and making informed financial decision. Sharpen your financial plan in a fun and interactive way.\n\nSpeaker:\nBoy Suhendri, Consumer Banking Group\n\nModerator:\nBilly, Consumer Banking Group\n-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-\n\n\nJOIN WEBEX MEETING\nhttps://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=mbad0eea08289041013dfb7e0f5b34aa9\nMeeting number (access code): 2516 583 3154\n\n\nMeeting password: 123!\n\n\n\nTAP TO JOIN FROM A MOBILE DEVICE (ATTENDEES ONLY)\n+65-3157-6442,,25165833154## tel:%2B65-3157-6442,,*01*25165833154%23%23*01* Singapore Toll\n\n\nJOIN BY PHONE\n+65-3157-6442 Singapore Toll\n\nGlobal call-in numbers\nhttps://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=m1e47cd0bb642d4536ad19fdec0f07067\n\n\nJOIN FROM A VIDEO SYSTEM OR APPLICATION\nDial sip:25165833154@dbs.webex.com\nYou can also dial 210.4.202.4 and enter your meeting number.\n\n\n\nIf you are a host, click here and login site to view host information:\nhttps://dbs.webex.com/webappng/sites/dbs/meeting/info/1df48ab5a12a4de790311b82c7448f73\n\n\n\nCan't join the meeting? Contact support here:\nhttps://dbs.webex.com/dbs/mc\n\n\nIMPORTANT NOTICE: Please note that this Webex service allows audio and other information sent during the session to be recorded, which may be discoverable in a legal matter. You should inform all meeting attendees prior to recording if you intend to record the meeting.\n
